            <ArticleTitle>Cyclosporine versus tacrolimus (FK 506) for prevention of cardiac allograft vasculopathy.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>266-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This study prospectively compared the impact of cyclosporine A and tacrolimus on the development of cardiac allograft vasculopathy. By using serial intravascular ultrasound examinations, a trend toward a more pronounced progression was noted in the tacrolimus group in the first year after heart transplantation.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
